    "title": "Rosendin Electric brings new regional headquarters to Chandler - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By AZ Business Magazine ,\n8 hours ago Rosendin Electric, Inc., the nation’s largest employee-owned electrical contractor, announced the purchase of Allred Park Place Building 4 in Chandler, Ariz., which will serve as the company’s new Mountain West regional headquarters. The new campus will unite Rosendin’s regional operations teams with its growing workforce and corporate teams, including Engineering, Technology, Analytics, BIM, and Innovation. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
